@startuml
title FE-11 Staff or Manager Moderates and Replies
actor Staff
actor Manager
participant ReviewModerationController
participant ReviewService
database ReviewRepository
database ReviewModerationEventRepository
database ReviewReplyRepository
Staff -> ReviewModerationController : hide review + version
ReviewModerationController -> ReviewService : authorize Staff scope
ReviewService -> ReviewRepository : set HIDDEN
ReviewService -> ReviewModerationEventRepository : append audit
Manager -> ReviewModerationController : remove or reply + version
ReviewModerationController -> ReviewService : authorize Manager action
ReviewService -> ReviewRepository : set REMOVED when requested
ReviewService -> ReviewReplyRepository : create or edit current reply
ReviewService -> ReviewModerationEventRepository : append audit
ReviewModerationController --> Staff : result
ReviewModerationController --> Manager : result
note over Staff,Manager
Admin has technical/audit access only.
end note
@enduml
